    "parent": "rack_A",
    "function": "Continuous-wave local oscillator for one drive or readout up-conversion chain. Its frequency sets the carrier the AWG envelopes are mixed onto; its output power sets the mixer drive level; and its phase noise is imprinted on every pulse, appearing as dephasing at the qubit for offsets inside the Rabi bandwidth. All generators are locked to the 10 MHz reference.",
